WEBVTT

00:11:59.089 --> 00:12:01.842
are fighting like hell and dying right now

00:12:01.842 --> 00:12:05.304
to remind us not to take
liberty for granted.

00:12:05.345 --> 00:12:06.930
Putin,

00:12:06.972 --> 00:12:09.099
like every dictator before him,

00:12:09.099 --> 00:12:12.352
underestimated the free will
of free people.

00:12:16.523 --> 00:12:22.279
They deserve every weapon,

00:12:22.321 --> 00:12:25.449
every resource

00:12:25.491 --> 00:12:26.742
to win this war.

00:12:27.618 --> 00:12:29.369
Because they're fighting for us.

00:12:29.411 --> 00:12:33.290
Not only for the whole and free Ukraine.